  "method": "The captured floor-windows response lists every desk as a positioned panel (CSS top/left on the 1375×1226 px floor) and every member as an 'employeepanel' (surname + electorate) bound to a desk; desks and members are paired one-to-one by desk id (47/47), then each division's member is verified against the 2022 election-night roster in map/data/res-sa22.json (44/47; Bragg, Dunstan and Black had changed hands at by-elections — each successor's member record is dated after its by-election, 2022-07-11, 2024-04-03, 2024-11-24). Employee records carry their creation date: the benches below were filed 25 March/1 April 2022, the current term's own seating, and were unchanged at the capture except as the by-elections and the Speaker's change forced. The Speaker label's printed centre (894, 120) is the coordinate origin.",
  "page": "The floor is drawn on 'HOA Chamber Map Final - v2.png' (1100×981, displayed at 1375×1226 CSS px): the Speaker's chair at the top, the Clerk and Chairman of Committees below it, the government's column of desks down the middle-left, the opposition's down the right, the crossbench off the opposition's foot. Seat coordinates are the desk's centre in that shifted frame, y increasing downward."
 },
